'''''Freesia'' × ''kewensis''''' is a species of plant in the family [[Iridaceae]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Freesia x kewensis - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/55576130|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Freesia × kewensis (Red river Freesia) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/IRID/Freesia_kewensis.php |access-date=2022-03-03 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref> It is an artificial hybrid between ''[[Freesia corymbosa]]'' and ''[[Freesia leichtlinii]]'' subsp. ''alba''.<ref name=POWO>{{cite web |url=http://www.plantsoftheworldonline.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:77163556-1 |title=''Freesia'' × ''kewensis'' J.Wright bis |date=2023 |website=Plants of the World Online |publisher=Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew|access-date=4 April 2023}}</ref>

